{"product_id":"not-a-trace","title":"Not a Trace","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe latest book in the Chloe and Levesque series, with the dramatic new series look. Chloe has a kind of grudging respect for David Mitchell, even though he appears to have a spring-loaded temper, so when hes charged with the murder of Trevor Blake, she cant decide whether hes guilty or not. Mitchell is definitely the likeliest suspect - he fought with Blake on the main street of East Hastings just before the murder - but then some of the clues at the scene of the crime just dont add up. Not a Trace will include a sneak peak at the new Robyn Hunter series, coming from Norah McClintock in 2006! \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:108 x 171  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Norah McClintock \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780439957601 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 260\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44898557919385,"sku":"11RB9780439957601","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/08aba176743029172418a2c43ebe0b77.jpg?v=1729003551","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/not-a-trace","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}